WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A Steane-code sector: seven variables and three parity checks.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Uniform error prior 0.10; initial LLR 2.20. Measured syndrome: [1, 1, 1].

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:26.900
BP round 1: variable-to-check messages, then check-to-variable messages.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.900
BP round 2 repeats the message updates using the updated LLRs.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.900
BP round 3 repeats the variable and check updates.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.400
The final estimate is [0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0]. Its syndrome matches the measurement.
